Megha Kadamba: lyric film. Every picture element is drawn in code.

Music: "Megha Kadamba" (from Rakta Golapa), supplied by the user. It is the only audio and is used as provided; the user is responsible for its rights.
Lyrics: Odia text supplied by the user.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, files and licences in fonts/):
- Noto Serif Oriya (Google / Noto project), github.com/google/fonts/ofl/notoseriforiya
- Baloo Bhaina 2 (Ek Type), github.com/google/fonts/ofl/baloobhaina2
- Cormorant Garamond (Christian Thalmann), github.com/google/fonts/ofl/cormorantgaramond (bundled, not used on screen)

Code: the watercolor stroke engine (engine_wc.js) is adapted from the Lemo-Opuscar library (MIT licence). Paper, pulp and fibre textures are generated procedurally (tools/textures.py).
